Package: hptiop-dkms
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: HighPoint RocketRAID 3xxx/4xxx driver (DKMS)
 Out-of-tree build of the hptiop SCSI driver for HighPoint RocketRAID
 3xxx/4xxx controllers (including the RR4520/RR4522), installed through DKMS
 so that it takes precedence over the driver shipped with the kernel.
 .
 Compared with the in-kernel driver it adds what the HighPoint RAID
 management service (hptsvr/hptraidconf) needs to detect and manage the
 controller: the /proc/scsi/hptiop interface, bidirectional mapping of
 management commands, and firmware device hot-plug notifications.
 .
 Supported kernels: Ubuntu 24.04 (6.8) and Ubuntu 26.04 (7.0).
